OL,3,GNEWSAI sang carols to the Ghost of
OL,4,AChristmas Present ` and Johnny Depp
OL,5,
OL,6,FA musician who usually performs on
OL,7,Fmovie soundtracks says it is "surreal"
OL,8,Fto be on-screen singing carols in
OL,9,FEbenezer ` the latest film adaptation
OL,10,Fof A Christmas Carol.
OL,12,F"There's a pivotal scene in a prison
OL,13,Fyard, and we're singing Silent Night
OL,14,Fwith the Ghost of Christmas Present and
OL,15,FJohnny Depp there," recalls
OL,16,FBedfordshire's Colin Fraser.
OL,18,FDepp plays the title character Ebenezer
OL,19,FScrooge in the Charles Dickens tale,
OL,20,Fstarring alongside Rupert Grint, Sir
OL,21,FIan McKellen and Daisy Ridley.
